WEBVTT

00:01:32.780 --> 00:01:34.890
You're from the preschool..?

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.280
Yes. Is Godai here?

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:40.000
He's out right now.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.870
Okay. Would you please
give this to him?

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:44.420
What's this?

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.870
It's the preschool teacher
certification exam study guide.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.720
Godai told me he wanted
to take a look at it.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:50.890
He did?

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:54.640
Why did Godai get
fired from preschool?

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.230
Did he cause
some kinda trouble?

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.690
It's just that we found a
new replacement teacher.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:02.620
That's it?

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:03.940
Yes.

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:10.340
That's nothing
to be ashamed about.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:12.560
I'm off!

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:15.000
Wait, Godai.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:20.590
No matter what you do,
please do your best.

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.020
I will!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:25.380
And um... Anyway.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:28.090
Here.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.900
Hello, everyone!

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:50.410
Hello, sir!

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.620
I'd like to announce
a new post.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.750
Mr. Godai of the
Publicity Department,

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.220
please step forward.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:00.320
Yes, sir!

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:02.590
In addition to your current
post in publicity,

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:05.190
I name you the
Chief of Welfare!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.190
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:03:08.870 --> 00:03:10.630
Let us work hard again today!

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:12.300
One!

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.300
Never stop smiling!

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:16.130
One!

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.570
Never stop smiling!

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:20.470
One!

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.150
A customer's smile is
a heap of treasure!

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:25.310
One!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.620
Come in! Come in, sir!

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.990
Experience paradise
at our low price!

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.490
Sing and drink at this
rock-bottom price!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:36.720
Come in! Come in! Come in!

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.460
You! You, Hot Stuff!
Come on in!

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.690
Sir! Experience paradise now!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.500
You're pretty good at this.

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.740
You look well, Yusaku.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:53.710
Grandma..?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.100
What're you doing here?!

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:59.070
She got here
this afternoon.

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:02.470
She has a class reunion
a week after next

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:04.190
Class reunion?

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.720
And I was worried about you.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.320
They told me the story.

00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:12.900
So you're going to become
a preschool teacher?

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:16.300
That's the plan for now.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:19.060
If that's what
you've decided,

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:20.980
I have no objections.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:22.430
Grandma.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:26.960
Come everyone!
Let's party hard tonight!

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:27.890
Huh?!

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:30.540
It's Grandma's
Welcome Party.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.500
It's so good of you to
come all the way here.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:36.750
G-Grandma!

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.380
Don't you worry
about money.

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:43.360
I've wanted to visit a
cabaret once before I die.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.300
I never knew it
was such a fun place!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.930
This could become a habit!

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.410
Don't hold back.
Drink as much as you want.

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:02.810
You're so generous!

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:04.870
We love you, Grandma.

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:10.290
She's your grandma?

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:14.250
I'm impressed.

00:05:14.320 --> 00:05:17.380
ordinary grannies
wouldn't feel so at home.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.230
I admire that.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.520
She's just an old lady
acting on a whim.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.120
If whimsy can get her
this far, that's great.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.330
Take care of her.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.570
Chief, let's play.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:44.570
Chief!

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:47.360
Okay. Okay.

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.560
What shall we do?

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:52.100
Let's play horsey!

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:53.250
Sure!

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:07.630
Ms. Otonashi!

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.850
I'm here to pick you up!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.420
Mitaka?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:17.950
Hello.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:24.800
Godai's Grandma!
You're looking well

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:28.120
Thank you.

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:32.660
You're here
to pick me up?

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.940
Remember? We have
tennis school.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.040
Hi.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:41.480
Hi.

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:45.420
Ms. Otonashi's parents have
taken a liking to me

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:47.610
ever since the day we met
at Soichiro's grave.

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.310
How nice for you.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.420
Why don't you
go get ready?

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.420
...since he's
here already.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:01.790
Perhaps you're being
too optimistic.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.760
It doesn't matter how much
her parents like you.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.480
It's how the manager
feels about you.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.440
Do you have enough money
saved up to elope?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.830
Why would I have to elope?

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:22.210
Her parents would never approve
of an aimless guy like you.

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:27.850
If that's the way
her parents feel, then.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.250
See? You have to
resort to eloping.

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.290
She marries you despite
everyone's opposition.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.670
You two end up
in a northern town.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.860
A life of poverty and
unimaginable hardship.

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:43.270
Oh, poor Ms. Otonashi

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.640
Must you paint
such a bleak picture?!

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:53.580
What are you talking about?

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:59.120
Nothing! Please
go ahead to my car.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:11.000
I'll capture her heart
before you get a real job.

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:17.250
See you!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:24.610
Mitaka! Hurry! Hurry!

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.870
Grandma, too..?

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.080
It bothers me...

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:41.450
What is Mitaka scheming?

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:45.560
What is it?

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.930
I'll do it for 1,OOO yen.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:50.220
I have a lot of
free time lately.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.070
No way.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.010
500 yen, then.

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:03.740
Here.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:12.090
So what about Sunday,
week after next?

00:09:13.140 --> 00:09:14.400
For what?

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.360
We have to meet
Mitaka's parents,

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:21.410
our daughter's
future in-laws.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:24.570
I don't remember approving
their marriage!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.410
Don't bother me at work
with nonsense like this!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.570
You don't get it, do you?!

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:32.910
Listen.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:36.150
Mitaka has been turning down
other talks of marriage because of Kyoko.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.350
That's his problem!

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.030
I don't care what you say!

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:42.990
I'm going to make sure
they tie the knot!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.460
Damn it!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:52.010
Yes. I'm calling
about that estimate..

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:55.540
Darn eavesdroppers!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:58.970
Yes. I shall see you
tomorrow, then. Thank you!

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.610
Grandma, you're very good.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.180
I've never lost at
Japanese battledore

00:10:11.260 --> 00:10:12.940
since I was a little girl

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.530
Go!

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:31.090
You've made me wait
a long time, Ms. Otonashi.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:35.310
But the obstacles are
beginning to clear away.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.880
I won't let you go.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:40.340
Never.

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:41.580
Coach!

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.200
Coach!

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:45.790
Yes...?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:47.890
We have a new student.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.660
Oh, I see.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.590
This is Coach Mitaka.

00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:05.070
I'm inexperienced, but I'm
pleased to join your class.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:37.940
You look pretty shocked.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:44.460
What are you
doing here, Asuna?

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:52.840
What's she doing here?

00:11:53.420 --> 00:11:55.700
I clearly broke off
the relationship.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:01.520
Asuna, please..

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:02.690
Yes?

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.250
Please come this way.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.940
That's the woman
with those dogs...

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.960
Last time I saw you.

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:22.910
I can't marry you.

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:37.190
G-Get a hold of
yourself, Asuna!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:47.270
I thought you understood.

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.440
Yes, but.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:56.600
you told me you
didn't dislike me.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:02.280
If you had told me then
that you didn't like me,

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.210
I would have killed myself.

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:12.080
I remember now! I thought
I'd seen her somewhere!

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.690
Her marriage interview photo!

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.590
That's the girl Coach
got set up with!

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:18.490
That's her?

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:22.900
Who knew he had
someone like that?

00:13:26.920 --> 00:13:29.600
This is getting
very interesting.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.680
I wonder where
this will lead?

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:43.190
So that's who Coach Mitaka
got set up with?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:46.190
Mitaka told us
he turned her down.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.830
She's got the nerve
to show up at the tennis court.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.620
She must really be
in love with Coach.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:57.310
Um... Asuna.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:58.190
Yes?

00:13:58.840 --> 00:13:59.860
Are your parents aware

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:03.370
that you've enrolled yourself
in tennis school?

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.410
Yes. They are very
supportive of my decision.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.110
They said it's a great idea

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:13.080
for me to get to know my
future husband's profession.

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:18.620
Excuse me. I need
to make a phone call

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.430
Coach is making
an escape.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:27.060
Um..

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.540
Is she going
to declare war?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:34.770
I bet.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.080
I suppose she
would become angry

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:42.450
if I asked her to
break up with Mitaka.

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.030
I better say something.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.130
Something...

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:03.800
How are your dogs?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:10.150
Yes. They're
in good health.

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:13.470
How about your Soichiro?

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.780
You remember his name?

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:20.660
I never forget a dog's name.

00:15:23.530 --> 00:15:25.650
They're chatting it up.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:30.160
What is going on, Uncle?!

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.800
You know what
I'm talking about!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.070
I'm talking about Asuna!

00:15:36.340 --> 00:15:39.960
Oh! What?

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:42.410
I have no interest in marrying her.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.970
No interest? Are you high?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.970
I made it very clear to Asuna.

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:53.470
You never heard?

00:15:57.360 --> 00:16:00.770
What? What're you
getting all excited about?

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.900
I'm going to the Kujo
residence this evening.

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:07.330
I'm going to set
the story straight with her parents!

00:16:14.550 --> 00:16:15.870
Disposable diapers, check.

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:17.680
Wet wipes, check.

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:22.020
We have enough formula.
I'm all set for today.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.750
The certification exam's
in September.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:31.620
It won't be easy.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:36.120
It'll take another year.

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:37.700
Chief!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:41.490
Great! I'm so
glad you're here!

00:16:41.740 --> 00:16:44.040
Kasumi, you're early.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.940
Go, Taro.

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.100
Hi Taro!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:53.310
Hi!

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:59.790
Taro really loves you,

00:16:59.990 --> 00:17:02.920
and he insisted on
coming here early.

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:04.110
Right?

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:05.150
Yup

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.560
Wouldn't it be great if
Chief became your Papa?

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.180
Yup!

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:16.470
You're such a joker.

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.360
You have a husband,
don't you, Kasumi?

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.170
I'm looking
for a new one now.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.210
Chief, don't you
love kids?

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.520
I l-love k-kids, but.

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:40.920
Chief! The truth is, I

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.860
Y-Your child is watching.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.590
Please look after my
Taro and Hanako.

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:53.090
Sure.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:18:00.020
Corporate Rule #3! Say it.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:01.740
Interoffice romance
is strictly prohibited!

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:06.110
So you know.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:11.080
You got it all wrong.
I never.

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:15.390
You can get fired, you know.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:22.120
Why me..?

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:31.080
Hello!

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:36.280
Hi, Shun!

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.410
We've been expecting you.

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:44.110
Uncle? Why are you here?

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.530
My determination is firm.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:49.890
What are you talking about?

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.560
That voice..?

00:18:58.100 --> 00:18:58.760
Can't be.

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:04.020
You're late, Shun.

00:19:04.220 --> 00:19:06.330
She's a nice young lady.

00:19:07.650 --> 00:19:09.640
Dad? Mom?

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.350
So you're finally going
to settle down?

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.500
That's a big weight
off our shoulders.

00:19:17.470 --> 00:19:19.690
You set me up.

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:24.710
I know you.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.510
You can't possibly
break up this peace.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:29.120
You wouldn't dare.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:40.310
I am not at all interested
in marrying her.

00:19:56.830 --> 00:19:59.420
Asuna! Please don't!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:00.930
Please let me die!

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.000
If I can't marry you,
I'd rather--!

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:14.010
Asuna! You love
Mitaka that much?!

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:15.750
I'm so touched!

00:20:19.120 --> 00:20:21.170
You have broken my heart forever.

00:20:25.590 --> 00:20:28.110
He hasn't changed at all

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:30.960
Health is everything.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:34.420
I can't tell them now.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.640
He's still involved with the woman
from the marriage interview?

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.830
Seems so.

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:48.880
So Mitaka's been lying?

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:50.990
Who knows.

00:20:51.380 --> 00:20:54.140
He seemed very troubled.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.940
This is leading up
to a turning point

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:00.300
You mean.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:10.230
Mitaka's been driven
into a corner.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:15.860
Manager won't be leisurely cleaning
like she does now.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:32.980
I'm off!

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:34.830
Bye!

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:38.830
Um..

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:39.650
Yes?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.500
I've decided to take

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:44.270
the preschool teacher
certification exam next year.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:45.990
Really?

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.510
So, um..

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:50.930
Manager.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:53.110
Well... uh...

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:54.630
Huh?

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.170
N-Nothing. Bye!

00:21:58.150 --> 00:21:59.520
Good luck!

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.290
Preschool teacher...

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:06.650
Not a care in the world.

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:10.190
Has she any idea
the position she's in?

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:19.810
Chief!

00:22:20.110 --> 00:22:21.050
Chief!

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:25.720
Come this way.

00:22:26.180 --> 00:22:27.310
What is it, Kasumi?

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:33.940
What's the matter?

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:41.790
You're the only one
I can rely on, Chief.

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:46.300
P-Please! You're going
to get me in trouble!

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:49.360
Chief!

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:51.770
Company rule #3!

00:22:52.110 --> 00:22:53.330
It's not like that!

00:22:58.050 --> 00:22:59.430
Chief!

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:08.790
Chief, please read this
after closing.

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:24.130
Dear Chief,

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:28.580
Please look after
Taro and Hanako.

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:31.900
From Kasumi

00:23:31.990 --> 00:23:34.880
Kasumi ran off
with a customer?

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:37.290
W-What'll we do?

00:23:38.290 --> 00:23:39.010
Papa!

00:23:51.710 --> 00:23:53.390
They're crying, Godai!

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:55.740
Hurry up and
go find the mother.

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:57.600
We can't party like this.

00:23:57.690 --> 00:23:58.800
I've looked!

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:03.680
Next: "Perfect Papa!
The "Mister Mom" Godai Story"

00:24:04.120 --> 00:24:05.580
She ran off?!
